WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.763
This query classifies product prices Missing values
are labeled

00:00:05.789 --> 00:00:11.647
missing Zero or negative prices are flagged invalid
and require review

00:00:13.391 --> 00:00:19.032
Positive prices are valid candidates Notice that the
query does not

00:00:19.045 --> 00:00:25.064
change the values Validation should often begin by
identifying problems

00:00:25.196 --> 00:00:26.551
not by overwriting them
